CMakeFiles/

# Documentation build artefacts. Named for what the engine emits (see
# cmake/sphinx.cmake and cmake/doxygen.cmake) so a stray in-tree build cannot be
# committed: deploy/ is the rendered site, doctrees*/ the Sphinx caches (both the
# stage-2 one and the separate stage-1 doctrees-index/), and the rest are
# doxygen/sphinx intermediates.
deploy/
doctrees/
doctrees-index/
*.doxyfile
*.doxygen-nav
*.tag

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
